{{ToonInfo|type=Event|Toon=Cocoa|extra=Chocolate Bunny|Date=April 18, 2025|with={{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, {{CI|Eggson|name=true}}, and {{CI|Flyte|name=true}}|Pronoun=She|event=Easter|store=Bassie's}}

==Appearance==
Cocoa is a light brown colored chocolate bunny, with a brown heart-shaped nose, and brown cheeks, as well as 2 sets of 2 eyelashes underneath her eyes and a darker brown drizzle of chocolate between her eyes. Her ears are long, droopy, and dark on the inside, and are tied together by a white scrunchie, resembling a ponytail. She has a white tail and white fluff around her neck, which seem to be made of whipped cream. Her arms and legs have a gradient from light to darker brown to the paws, which are dark brown and heart shaped.

==Personality==
Cocoa is a kind, energetic and jolly [[Toon]] who is always trying to be helpful and assist the other Toons as much as possible. She believes that even the "wrong" types of Toons need help at times, even if they don't ask for it. As shown in an interaction with {{CI|Eggson|name=true}}, she is always overworking herself to help others. She sometimes is even seen pushing help on others before finally backing off as seen in a few interactions. She seems to be persistent in what she believes in. In Cocoa's dialogues with {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, she is still seen viewing her as her friend, likely not knowing about Bassie's resentment and envy towards her.

