*{{StarRow|4}} (1.2) → 1.8 (18 units filled in 10 seconds)
*{{StarRow|5}} (1.5) → 2.25 (22.5 units filled in 10 seconds)
</tabber>

Overall, while Cocoa leans mostly into support, she can be a good extractor or distractor, being able to use her BonBons to her advantage. She can be really great in teams or in solo runs, with a somewhat versatile set of Stats and Ability.

===Trinket Combinations===
{{Preference}}
Given she has high speed with lower Stamina, high Stealth, and low Extraction Speed, recommended [[Trinket]] combinations for Cocoa include:

====Mobility====
*'''{{TI|Dog Plush|name=true}}/Options'''
**This [[Trinket]] will unlock the role of distractor to the holder, or, if one doesn't desire to distract, just further improves Cocoa's mobility {{Small|(19.3 Walk Speed)}}. Here are some options to pair Dog Plush with:
***'''{{TI|Speedy Shoes|name=true}}''', to allow Cocoa to outwalk Twisteds slower than {{CI|Twisted Toodles|name=true}} and {{CI|Twisted Shelly|name=true}} {{Small|(20.2 Walk Speed)}};
***'''{{TI|Clown Horn|name=true}}/{{TI|Ribbon Spool|name=true}}''', to out-walk even faster [[Twisteds]]. Keep in mind this only works half the time, and is best used when duo-distracting {{Small|(21 Walk Speed)}};
****Do note this Trinket combo is best used when duo-distracting with another player.
***'''{{TI|Vanity Mirror|name=true}}''', to out-run almost all Twisteds during [[Panic Mode]] while active {{Small|(35.75 run speed)}};
***'''{{TI|Train Whistle|name=true}}''', so you can distract {{CI|Twisted Vee|name=true}} or during [[Ichor Leaks]] without being slowed;
***'''{{TI|Scrapbook|name=true}}''', to avoid other 4{{Star}} [[Stealth]] Toons taking away the Twisteds' aggro;
****Do note that this Trinket will not lower your Stealth enough to be able to distract around 3 Star Stealth and below [[Toons]].
***'''{{TI|Bone|name=true}}/{{TI|Feather Duster|name=true}}''', to gain a slight speed or Stamina boost for every {{II|BonBons|name=true}} collected;
***'''{{TI|Whispering Flower|name=true}}''', to gain more Stamina regeneration by stocking up on {{II|BonBons|name=true}};
***Any of the Trinkets in the '''Extraction Section''', to help with [[Floor]] progression; etc.

====Extraction====
*'''{{TI|Magnifying Glass|name=true}}/Options'''
**This Trinket allows Cocoa to take full advantage over her 2{{Star}} [[Extraction Speed]] {{Small|(0.85 extraction speed)}} and 3 Star [[Skill Check]] {{Small|(100.5 skill check size)}}. Here are some options to pair Magnifying Glass with:
***'''{{TI|Vee's Remote|name=true}}''', to allow for quicker Floor progression, especially if teammates also carry Vee's Remote;
***'''{{TI|Participation Award|name=true}}''', to speed up [[Machine]] completion by maximizing Skill Check extraction {{Small|(27.95 avg/24.84 with Tech Savvy)}};
***Any Trinkets listed in the '''Mobility''' section, to help with survival.

====Ability/Support====
*'''{{TI|Ghost Snakes In A Can|name=true}}''', to reduce {{AI|Cocoa|name=true}}<nowiki/>'s [[Ability]] cooldown {{Small|(35s)}};
**'''{{TI|Sweet Charm|name=true}}''', to further reduce '''BonBon'''<nowiki/>'s cooldown, though only by a small amount as the Trinket works with percentages {{Small|(32s)}}.
*'''{{TI|Glazed Fondant Bag|name=true}}''', to give a boost to the [[BonBon]] that Cocoa drops. More useful in solos or runs with multiple Cocoas;

