==Trivia==
*Cocoa, {{CI|Rudie|name=true}} and {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}} are all anthropomorphic [[Toons]] with non-plantigrade legs (Cocoa and Eclipse are digitigrade, while Rudie is unguligrade). Cocoa is the second Toon with this trait.
*Cocoa used to be able to spawn as many {{II|BonBons|name=true}} as she wanted at a time, but this was changed in [[Changelog|v0.8.4]] so that there could only be 10 BonBons on the floor at once.
**This was implemented to prevent players from spawning excessive BonBons on one Floor to farm {{Tape|name=true}} or [[Machines]], and also to stop them from drawing or writing inappropriate content.
***This however could be countered by having a {{CI|Bassie|name=true}} pick up the BonBons and place them back down, which would essentially reset the intended limit until [[Changelog|v0.25.1]].
*BonBons are Cocoa's favorite sweets, as seen through her dialogues, her Active [[Ability]], and her and {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}'s interaction.
*Cocoa's friendship with [[Bassie]] is very complex, with Bassie seeming to act cold towards Cocoa despite how friendly she is towards her. This is seen in shared dialogues with her. 
**This is due to Bassie being secretly envious of Cocoa, due to [[Delilah]] likely wanting her to be a {{Type|Main}} instead of Bassie.
*Cocoa could be friends with {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}, as she requires surviving 20 [[Floors]] with Yatta for her [[Mastery]] and because their interactions show them being friendly to each other.
**In her interaction with Yatta, Yatta stated that she wanted to eat her, all because Cocoa was supposedly made out of chocolate.
*Cocoa is the first non-[[Main Character]] Toon that has a plush version of herself, as seen in the [[Easter Floor]].
**This may be because [[Delilah]] wanted her to be the [[Easter]] Main Character.
**She's also the first non-Main Character to have an official plush in real life.
*Cocoa has a chubbier body compared to most [[Toons]], similarly to {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}, [[Rudie]], and {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1366613814665150515</ref>
**That makes Cocoa the third Toon that is canonically chubby.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1377836498782650408</ref>
*Cocoa was one of the most difficult [[Toons]] to turn from 2D art to a 3D model, essentially due to her snout, the other one being {{CI|Coal|name=true}}.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1366508342805139526</ref>
**Additionally, it took more than 7 to 9 attempts to try to model her snout.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1366508509012820069</ref>
*Cocoa's Active [[Ability]] is labeled as "Bonbon" in the [[Lobby]] and [[Bassie's Store]]. However, in Elevator intermission before a round, there was a bug where it was labeled as "Chocolate Bunny". This has been fixed, and it's now labeled as "Bonbon".
*Cocoa's name is a reference to the seed of the cacao tree, which is used to make chocolate. Given that she is a chocolate Easter bunny, the name fits.
*Cocoa is the first [[Toon]] whose [[Mastery]] doesn't require the use of her Active [[Ability]].
**Even though one quest is to eat 35 BonBons, another Cocoa can help spawn one for you, technically making Cocoa's Mastery completable without using her Active Ability.
***Another way, although much, much less reliable due to RNG and limited usage per run, would be through the Blind Grab and Lost and Found [[Cards]].
*Cocoa's official voice actor is Toastymarshmellow as she sings in the song [[Wilting]].
**This makes her the fifth Holiday [[Toon]], alongside [[Bassie]], to have an official voice actor, the first three being the [[Christmas Toons]] (excluding [[Coal]]).
*Cocoa was the first Non-Main [[Toon]] to get a Security Recording without the presence of other [[Toons]].
*It's implied that Cocoa was the non-direct reason Bassie became a [[Twisted]], as Cocoa took on the responsibility of decorating better than Bassie, who can be seen accidentally dropping decorations. Bassie, having a fear of being replaced, was presumably jealous of this, clenching her fist when {{CI|Eggson|name=true}} and {{CI|Flyte|name=true}} seemingly celebrate or congratulate Cocoa as seen in the [https://youtu.be/gukB89e5O_Y?si=zZN-nhEb_QnhUGGH Wilting music video].
**Bassie could also be the reason Cocoa turned twisted, but there is minimal evidence for this, aside from possibly the ending scene of the [https://youtu.be/gukB89e5O_Y?si=zZN-nhEb_QnhUGGH Wilting music video] and her {{CI|Twisted Cocoa}}[[Twisted Cocoa|Twisted counterpart]]'s seemingly injured appearance.

